      "reasons": [
        "The definition states that, in psychology-related discussions, CSEs “involve sustained sensory, cognitive, and organizational stress.” The packet instead frames this as “suggest[ing] that CSEs may experience a distinct constellation of occupational stressors” and notes it “has not been systematically examined,” so the definition overstates the certainty of this claim.",
        "The packet supports prolonged close proximity to violent/graphic environments and the presence of intersecting pressures, but it does not explicitly establish that this amounts to “sustained sensory, cognitive, and organizational stress” as a direct, established psychology-related role."
